## Installation

<InstallCommand pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui" shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/slider.json" />

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as Slider from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/slider";
</script>

<Slider.Root aria-label="Volume" defaultValue={50} />
```

## API Reference

### Slider.Root

The root accepts a number or an array for range sliders. It defaults to `min={0}`, `max={100}`, and
edge-aligned thumbs. Use `defaultValue` for the initial value or `bind:value` for controlled state.

### Slider.Value

The value part displays the current formatted value and points to the thumb inputs.

The package also exports `Slider.Control`, `Slider.Track`, `Slider.Indicator`, `Slider.Thumb`, and
`Slider.Label` for custom compositions. See the [Shards Slider API](https://shardsui.com/svelte/slider)
for drag, keyboard, formatting, and form props.

## Examples

For accessible labelling and validation, prefer using the `Field` component to wrap checkboxes. See the related example: [Slider field](/docs/components/field#slider-field).

